n in both MSC Jehangir et al. Partial thick-Xe WJ-MSC, 1 × 105cells/cm Rat (35) posite scaffold and colla-1 × 105groups, best in A-PCL-WJ-MSC group (2022) [80] ness human (P1) gen (two groups) with complete epidermal restoration and near normal skin appendage\n",
